      "id": "tt_7591289647020494102",
      "text": "Tigers symbolize strength, courage, and confidence in many cultures around the world. Flowers often rpresent beauty, growth, and the gentle side of nature. When thinking about tigers and flowers together, they show how nature can be both powerful and soft at the same time. The tigers beauty comes from its bold stripes and fearless presence. The beuauty of flowers comes from their colors, shapes, and calming efect. Both remind us that beauty is not only about appearance, but also meaning and feeling. together, tigers and flowers teach us to respect nature in all its forms. #tiger #moodboard #culture #art #flowers ",
